<title>USA: US spot MTBE taken down by NYMEX, weak demand.</title>
<headline>US spot MTBE taken down by NYMEX, weak demand.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cts/Gallon  Prompt(Feb)	Any (Mar)	 01/30/97(PptJan)</p>
<p>Houston     77.75/78.75	78.75/79.75     82.50/83.50</p>
<p>New York    82.00/83.00	89.00/90.00 N   91.00/91.50</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Spot MTBE prices tumbled in slow activity, taking a beating from plunging NYMEX gasoline futures, ample supply and scant demand, players said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Meanwhile, Texas Petrochemicals Corp doused market rumors it had restarted the No 2 unit at its Houston MTBE plant, which had been taken down due to poor margins.</p>
